1. To edit the last committed msg:
    a. git commit --amend -m "New Msg"
    b. git push --force

    By using above 2 commands we can edit the last msg committed , so it create a new id for the new msg, but still it removes the last previously committed id and msg from history, by that we can hv a clean history.

